        <mxCell id="bdVDdEH1HraDsdLs_XuL-1" parent="9Fz6bAIcim4H4Dxhs74H-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=0;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;points=[[0,0,1,0,0],[0.25,0,1,0,0],[0.5,0,1,0,0],[0.75,0,1,0,0],[1,0,1,0,0],[0,0.25,1,0,0],[0,0.5,1,0,0],[0,0.75,1,0,0],[1,0.25,1,0,0],[1,0.5,1,0,0],[1,0.75,1,0,0],[0,1,1,0,0],[0.25,1,1,0,0],[0.5,1,1,0,0],[0.75,1,1,0,0],[1,1,1,0,0],[0.333333,0.46875,0,0,0]];" value="&lt;div&gt;从火焰图上已经找不到可优化的点了&lt;/div&gt;目前已完成四类主要热点优化：减少线程数降低 epoll/schedule 上下文切换开销，通过批量 Flush 降低 send 系统调用频率，通过协程减少 Callback 带来的 allocator 开销，再通过 Timer Lazy Cancel 消除高频 timerfd_settime 系统调用。" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="87.5" width="250" x="10480" y="2378.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
